	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『デジモンアドベンチャー02』より「ブラックウォーグレイモン」がFigure-rise Standardから立体化！",
			"• 装甲のブラックにはメタリックの成形色を使用し、印象的なカラーリングを実現。",
			"• 両腕を上げる、胸を反る、大きく足を広げるなど多様なポージングが可能。",
			"• 劇中の必殺技「暗黒のガイアフォース」や「ドラモンキラー」を振るうアクションを再現できる、広い可動域を確保。",
			"• シールドは左右で独立可動し、ポージングに合わせた角度付けが可能。"
		],
		"en": [
			"\"Black War Greymon\" from \"Digimon Adventure 02\" is now three-dimensional from Figure-rise Standard!",
			"• The black armor uses metallic molding color to create an impressive coloring.",
			"• Various poses are possible, such as raising both arms, arching the chest, and spreading the legs wide.",
			"• It has a wide range of motion that allows you to recreate the action of wielding the special moves \"Dark Gaia Force\" and \"Dramon Killer\" from the movie.",
			"• Seal can be moved independently on the left and right sides, allowing you to angle it to suit your pose."
		]
	},
